(
    description: "Natural bonus spawns: with Bonuses on, BonusFrequency 1 s, BonusLife 3 s and BonusHealthToWeaponChance 0.3, the server spawns a bonus at a FindSpot position whenever more than 1 s has passed since the last spawn (a health or a weapon bonus by one rand(), the weapon by another), and frees each slot once it is older than BonusLife, telling the client to destroy its copy. The client's bonuses fall to the ground. The restriction file is OLX's `Bonus only` preset, which makes every Classic weapon bonus-only, so any of the 38 may be in a bonus (`bonus-natural-default` plays the default `Standard 100lt`). One worm stands on Liero Factory's open rock floor and walks right.",
